# Desktop > Edit Pattern (MAIN.CPL dialog 34): Boxes loaded, Critters picked, "Mine" added with the
# mnemonic a while OK has the focus (the focus stays on OK), OK; Enter then presses the Desktop's
# focused "Edit Pattern..." again, as on 3.11 (CONTROL.INI [Patterns] Mine=).
# Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/desktop-editpat.scn.
# Run: ARCH311_REF=<rig> ARCH311_REF_INI=1 tools/run-cp-test.sh apps/control/tests/desktop-editpat.w16 OUT Desktop
# The rig caught no frame with OK focused (06-okfocus).
# regress: ARCH311_REF_INI=1 sh tools/run-cp-test.sh "$TEST" "$OUT" Desktop
# compare: desk-editpat/02.png 01-desktop.png active ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 338 334 350 354
# compare: desk-editpat/03.png 02-editbutton.png active ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 338 334 350 354
# compare: desk-editpat/04.png 03-editpattern.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: desk-editpat/05.png 04-critters.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: desk-editpat/06.png 05-mine.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: desk-editpat/07.png 07-added.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: desk-editpat/08.png 08-back.png active ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 338 334 350 354
# compare: desk-editpat/09.png 09-again.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# ini: CONTROL.INI Patterns Mine=0 80 114 32 0 5 39 2
sleep 600
shot shots/01-desktop.png
key down
key down
key tab
sleep 200
shot shots/02-editbutton.png
key space
sleep 600
shotcaret shots/03-editpattern.png
key down
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/04-critters.png
type Mine
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/05-mine.png
key tab
key tab
sleep 200
shot shots/06-okfocus.png
key a
sleep 300
shot shots/07-added.png
key enter
sleep 500
shot shots/08-back.png
key enter
sleep 800
shotcaret shots/09-again.png
quit
